.TH NMAP 1 "December 2024" "Network Security" "Lab Commands"
.SH NAME
nmap_lab \- Customized Nmap commands for Practical System Audit Lab
.SH DESCRIPTION
Key Nmap commands used for network scanning and basic vulnerability
assessment (Lab Sheet 5: Part 2, Step 1).
.SH BASIC SCANNING
.TP
.B Discover active hosts
nmap -sn Network_IP/24
.TP
.B Identify open ports
nmap TARGET_IP
.SH ADVANCED SCANS
.TP
.B Service version and default scripts
nmap -sV -sC -T4 TARGET_IP
.TP
.B Vulnerability scripts (search for known CVEs)
nmap --script vuln TARGET_IP
.TP
.B Operating system detection
nmap -O TARGET_IP
.TP
.B Aggressive scan (no ping) on common ports
nmap -A -Pn -p22,80,139,445 TARGET_IP
.SH AUTHOR
Exam preparation cheat-sheet.

